{"v":4,"catch":"「依靠這種力量……真的好嗎？」\n在屈服於惡魔的力量之前登上塔頂，\n重返天界的Roguelike遊戲。","desc":"『墮入魔界的拉茲瑞爾』是集合了卡牌、Rogue-like與黑化要素的遊戲。你將扮演誤入魔界的天使，在屈服於惡魔的力量之前登上塔頂，重返天界。\n\n為了在魔界獨自求生，即便是天使有時也不得不借助惡魔的力量。\n但若是對此過於仰賴，沉澱在體內的罪孽會對身心都造成極大影響。\n究竟拉茲瑞爾能否登上塔頂，平安無事地返回天界？","publisher":"Waku Waku Games","release":"2024-03-14","genres":["策略","角色扮演"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","韓文","中文 (簡體字)","中文 (繁體字)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 1.1GB / Switch 1.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c828421461426937de4fabacbba0c47c7d7d0a769f4f31e27b3916c2843a039d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/80713e8f042d29f073d7ef4e657f330e602055468fd7af131965c7fadc8b2704.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4a16f755e8788e0fe7d249549249747abebcd4a25e02c0386af541e77f336427.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d482eace89b6f4ebff3f093752a903030f5d44c5f768bed8952e0d718cd1b501.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e2dd11e64c26b72c29f7ac15b9290073e97a7bfd583d7aca1188c7d48f5f8cc5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8ea537e85be1d3454072e782704c7704dde8b340c5c854fcfeca7c484aaa0367.jpg"],"titleId":"01008db01cfd2000","dlc":[],"vids":["kShfrIAQwiU"]}